<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Horror</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A 7 story building, each floor representing one of the seven deadly sins</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> My SCP is going to (hopefully) be SCP-5188. Each floor is one of the seven deadly sins.<br />
1. Lust (Im going to expunge most of the data)</p>
<p>2. Gluttony (Table full of favorite foods that trigger nostalgia and memetic effects)</p>
<p>3. Greed (Million dollars on the table. Take it or leave it.)</p>
<p>4. Sloth (Memetic effects make you tired. You have a mission, but theres a nice comfy bed right over there, Why not lie down&#8230;)</p>
<p>5. Wrath (Worst enemy in life, and/or thing that caused a horrible feeling. Supposed to trigger hate.)</p>
<p>6. Envy (Person with something youve always wanted, they leave it out of their sight, working on something)</p>
<p>7. Pride (Theres a 1st, 2nd, and 3rd place stand. Get on one, or help someone else on)</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The 7 deadly sins, all leading to the roof. Must be some reward.</p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you want the sandbox article for further critique, ask for it please.</p>

